(text "38kHz demodulating receiver records pulse timings from the ORIGINAL REMOTE.\nTwo 940nm emitters use independent 33ohm resistors; firmware caps duty and transmission length.\nLearned / trial commands are saved only after the user confirms success; no passive device readout is possible." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 23cbfbd9-6dd9-4e6b-a88d-df98320fddb2))
